 "summary": "This is an at-will employment agreement dated 29 April 2025 between Northwind Labs, Inc. and Sofia Lindqvist for the Senior Data Engineer role, governed by Delaware law, with a $118,000 annual base salary. It contains generic commercial boilerplate (audit, insurance, warranties, non-solicit) that fits poorly with an employment relationship and has no fixed term, renewal or liability cap."
